ody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">logInDJIUserAccount</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">FragmentActivity</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">fragmentActivity</span>, <span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">isFullScreen</span>, <span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">callback</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">通过调出登陆界面登陆DJI账号。<code><a href=\"IUserAccountManager.html#iuseraccountmanager_loginstate\">LoginState</a></code>为<code><a href=\"IUserAccountManager.html#iuseraccountmanager_loginstate_not_logged_in\">NOT_LOGGED_IN</a></code>或者<code><a href=\"IUserAccountManager.html#iuseraccountmanager_loginstate_token_out_of_date\">TOKEN_OUT_OF_DATE</a></code>时需要调用此接口进行登陆账号。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>fragmentActivity</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">FragmentActivity</span> </code></span></td><td>fragmentActivity</td></tr><tr><td><code>isFullScreen</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true表示全屏显示登陆框</td></tr><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span> <wbr><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks.html#djicommoncallbacks\"><span class=\"jv-prefix\">CommonCallbacks</span></a><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">.</span><a href=\"../DJICommonCallbacks/DJICommonCallbacks_CompletionCallback.html#djicommoncallbacks_completioncallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CompletionCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iuseraccountmanager_logindjiuseraccountwithinterface\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iuseraccountmanager_logindjiuseraccountwithinterface_inline\">logInDJIUserAccount</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iuseraccountmanager_logindjiuseraccountwithinterface_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>logInDJIUserAccount</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">logInDJIUserAccount</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">userName</span>, <span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">password</span>, <span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">verificationCode</span>,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                                  <span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</spa